  lines:
  - speakerName: Zoran
    text: Hey there!
    choices: {fileID: 0}
  - speakerName: Zoran
    text: You must be here to finally get your companion!
    choices: {fileID: 0}
  - speakerName: Zoran
    text: Isn't that exciting, eh?
    choices: {fileID: 0}
  - speakerName: Zoran
    text: Just head on over to the table to the right to get started.
    choices: {fileID: 0}
  - speakerName: Zoran
    text: It will be diving into your mind to see what companion is the right fit
      for you.
    choices: {fileID: 0}
  - speakerName: Zoran
    text: What are you waiting for? Go on!
    choices: {fileID: 0}
